{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4rierz7f225", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "There are no new measles cases today. The number of known measles cases nationally remains at 17, of whom 12 are no longer infectious. We will continue to publish updates when new information becomes available.", "content_hash": "7a6223a4a8c1647cd49798da6641c1c03fb0699131268560f374f1551f593ac8", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4rierz7f225", "cid": "bafyreiedbcgdopoct7m3bobwm5wef5dlnu734a5gz4sxoigztix7fyvqfy", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Tile with text explaining that there are no new measles cases today, 4 Nov. ", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreiaqpg56ihuvbyroph2rk4wwht6y6pmwodofhfhn5v4ykukydmwyh4", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreiaqpg56ihuvbyroph2rk4wwht6y6pmwodofhfhn5v4ykukydmwyh4"}], "original_created_at": "2025-11-04T02:28:14.747Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4rierz7f225.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4rierz7f225", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4pkun2w4s2y", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "Kia ora, the advice is only for people who have lived in NZ/grown up in NZ. Best to check your overseas records to see if you've been immunised with two doses of MMR, or check with the health service of your previous country to find out your likely status. Your GP may have advice.", "content_hash": "1b48432a1e0e584034e6bc2202db2927d08cfca08598ae63888f9b751ede9523", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4pkun2w4s2y", "cid": "bafyreidqgz4n3ryrchm6tdkfq5gn4xub42xr2fdiz5efk2weyw53ihm3qu", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-11-03T08:07:34.440Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4pkun2w4s2y.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4pkun2w4s2y", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4pk7jhpoc2y", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "Kia ora, we've been clear NZ has a measles outbreak with community spread. There's a system wide plan for managing the outbreak, the measles immunisation week is just an extra 'push' on top of everything else happening. We will be promoting MMR till the outbreak is contained and regularly as BAU.", "content_hash": "f476fa62cf18fb23dac8e26d95f1c4ed6e309965fbb43c8b49d5f0397c71cc01", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4pk7jhpoc2y", "cid": "bafyreifml27hblzf3e4qbvs6mrm5wjmjst7hlvzchre2xtp3qcedv7x7b4", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-11-03T07:55:46.021Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4pk7jhpoc2y.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4pk7jhpoc2y", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4p74qfoks2f", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "There are no new cases of measles today. The number of known measles cases nationally remains at 17, 12 of whom are no longer infectious.\n\nHealth New Zealand continues to investigate any unlinked cases, and we expect to have more information in the coming days. www.tewhatuora.govt.nz/corporate-in...", "content_hash": "f8a5dad887f613e66973399a4e47d52cfe3695381c49fd8ba0b2376525289f72", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4p74qfoks2f", "cid": "bafyreif65isqxv4hzc2hngasxcvqr2b2prnpqvyqgoxbouy3pnginpusce", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-11-03T04:37:21.472Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4p74qfoks2f.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4p74qfoks2f", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4oqausc7c2a", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "Two doses of the MMR vaccine provide 99% of people with protection against measles. Check if you're fully immunised and if not, book with your usual health provider, or lots of pharmacies can do MMR vaccination. Or book online: bookmyvaccine.health.nz", "content_hash": "92c7ac4079e3f78bc9060e58222c3c7b0c410ab1af914da5f538a442e545feb9", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4oqausc7c2a", "cid": "bafyreiftfdvdclz2ldjggtdisxjqvahxpuhrrs4braos2oox3robybl4uu", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-11-03T00:11:14.170Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4oqausc7c2a.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4oqausc7c2a", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4ommcv3k22q", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "Check your measles immunisation status by visiting info.health.nz/measles or calling the Vaccination Helpline 0800 28 29 26 (Free, available Monday to Friday 8:30am-9pm, and weekends 8:30am-2pm).", "content_hash": "7a71f69d49616b797a0b2c96b70d709116d5ea5e6043c5407a59c6d1d3a27b05", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4ommcv3k22q", "cid": "bafyreidad3jdon4t62xhmltwssf7npklrp7vvknhhr64ytc5dzfjptb23y", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-11-02T23:06:03.072Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4ommcv3k22q.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4ommcv3k22q", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4okjxeodj22", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "It’s Measles Immunisation Week! 🛡️\n\n📲 Visit info.health.nz/immunisations/immunisation-clinics for pop up clinics near you where you can get your MMR vaccination. \n\nYou can also check healthpoint.co.nz. \n\nAnother option is to book online: info.health.nz/bookavaccine ", "content_hash": "769325f5e45d2bff925b400f4270d03946de78379fd336981e2a52754d6d4328", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4okjxeodj22", "cid": "bafyreidhaulbkr6x66j4gcnl43qekg7n3lxp7kzgsjvwphngn3e4odntue", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Tile with text that says: measles immunisation week - 3-7 November. Make sure you're fully protected. ", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreia46pfq7otk46oiacxt34lj4kxcwnexveqsx5f7iuktoaaeutqb5u", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreia46pfq7otk46oiacxt34lj4kxcwnexveqsx5f7iuktoaaeutqb5u"}], "original_created_at": "2025-11-02T22:28:56.381Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4okjxeodj22.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4okjxeodj22", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4mgkac6dp2i", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "Measles update - Today we’re confirming one new case of measles in the Auckland region, bringing the total number of known cases nationally to 17. Stay up to date: info.health.nz/conditions-treatments/infectious-diseases/about-measles", "content_hash": "bf4ec8ee79d46fc2bd126a94a5812610a0d28a9fcb0d93a549ab2235cfb828a2", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4mgkac6dp2i", "cid": "bafyreihddienwiits3swglfcze2w3imhx6swcekrrmpthvk3ztiwvhqpzm", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Decorative tile with text that says: Measles update 2 Nov. One new case confirmed in Auckland. 17 current total known cases. New case is linked to previously identified overseas-acquired case. Locations of interest will be published on our website as they're confirmed.", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreib3vdvnccjgfxkfa733mssxqgiizxxrpowqourchpxfuiaeqju5wq", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreib3vdvnccjgfxkfa733mssxqgiizxxrpowqourchpxfuiaeqju5wq"}], "original_created_at": "2025-11-02T02:12:11.308Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4mgkac6dp2i.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4mgkac6dp2i", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "health-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz/post/3m4k5vewtbn27", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:12+00:00", "content": "Two new measles cases confirmed in Wellington. Total cases now 16. ℹ️ Stay informed and check for updates on locations of interest: spr.ly/633277Hg1x", "content_hash": "981ef3d3a62bcd00d7bedd92a76d750904c2ace02a899e39d98d545583c49f79", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4k5vewtbn27", "cid": "bafyreiald4hirgolcjwkciokseiyzyy6nxfwxtjj2lo6m2bitoyees7jau", "source_id": "health-nz-bluesky-50ecdc9e"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Decorative tile with text that says: measles outbreak update 1 Nov. 2 new cases confirmed - Wellington. Current total known cases - 16. One case connected to Wellington Girls' College, second case still being investigated for links to other cases. ", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreibuki3aylr5infcxccmibtt4ayyi23zhqjfyoooodcukqhtrbb37a", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mb6xslgolu5gudovx5qgpxmv/bafkreibuki3aylr5infcxccmibtt4ayyi23zhqjfyoooodcukqhtrbb37a"}], "original_created_at": "2025-11-01T04:32:02.113Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m4k5vewtbn27.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m4k5vewtbn27", "source_account": "healthnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/healthnz.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "ministry-of-health", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/health.govt.nz/post/3m6usttg5ik2p", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:15+00:00", "content": "Read the full report and media release here: \nwww.health.govt.nz/publications/hiv-monitoring-report-2025 \nwww.health.govt.nz/news/world-aids-day-progress-on-hiv-celebrated-today-more-work-to-be-done", "content_hash": "a0a23eef6e67849e25c785031b2d92a35f04abbd970bec549f3cd6eafa2d7e79", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nyyntdr37nga3w4lq4kba6la/app.bsky.feed.post/3m6usttg5ik2p", "cid": "bafyreiepicw7nmtwpk257y4bkecc2u6lju4l2xxfh3ueh2fhrargzctx2q", "source_id": "ministry-of-health-bluesky-c521eae2"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-11-30T21:03:59.426Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-11\\3m6usttg5ik2p.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3m6usttg5ik2p", "source_account": "health.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/health.govt.nz"}
